# The top-level vendored repositories are pinned, SolidKG-maintained SCIP
# indexer sources. Keep them in GitHub source archives so users can audit and
# rebuild the exact compatibility-tested variants instead of substituting a
# floating upstream release. Native parser metadata is tracked in source; the
# target libraries are staged from the pinned language-pack release at build time.

# Initial public archives ship the user/legal documentation, not the internal
# benchmark reports, evidence bundles, research notes, or planning packets.
